turnip: SWEET_BO_STATS, the live buffers by name

Every buffer is a kernel call on the sweet backend; with SWEET_BO_STATS=N
the backend prints, every N allocations, how many buffers of each name
turnip made and keeps.

--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl.h
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl.h
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@
 #ifdef TU_HAS_SWEET
    /* CPU mapping created by the kernel at MEM_ALLOC time */
    void *sweet_map;
+   uint8_t sweet_stat;     /* SWEET_BO_STATS slot of its name */
 #endif
 
